{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想在家一邊深蹲一邊玩遊戲？《Squatty Bird》是一款以身體動作操控的飛行遊戲，玩家把 iPhone 前置鏡頭對準全身，就能用深蹲帶動小鳥穿過圓環，適合想輕鬆活動筋骨、又不想添置器材的用家。程式原價 US $2.99，現時終生版內購<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-112.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>鏡頭辨識動作即時操控</h2>\n<p>《Squatty Bird》以 iPhone 前置鏡頭辨識全身動作，玩家只要按節奏深蹲，就能控制小鳥穿過圓環。內置五個關卡與四種難度，飛行學校完全免費，其餘關卡可在單次完成 50 次標準深蹲賺取金幣解鎖。所有動作辨識均在裝置上進行，毋須帳號、穿戴裝置或額外控制器，亦可選擇錄影並保留成績。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-371-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-372-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-373-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-374-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-375-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-376-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Squatty Bird: Squat to Fly 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Squatty Bird: Squat to Fly</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/squatty-bird/id6811368513\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:40:37.481368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":470,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T00:33:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T20:38:45.082006+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:38:29.590403+00:00","content_hash":"c047318f2cb6d19b1c5230a57b88dd0c67af5fdd10c6ea5e97f005676895d125","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}